{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Face your fears, survive the chaos.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up. Work. Drink. Sleep. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That was your life \u2014 until everything went out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, everything is... wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your apartment is rotting. The bar is empty and silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the office has become a maze where creatures wait in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not a hero.\u00a0You have no weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can only run \u2014 or get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/gif_02.gif?t=1750269686\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FoMO is a first-person psychological horror game focused on consequences, escape, and constant tension. No intense combat. Danger is everywhere \u2014 and you need to think fast to get away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, hide, survive. With random mazes, every run is unique. No escape is the same. The retro visuals and pixelated 3D graphics create a nostalgic \u2014 yet disturbing \u2014 atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re trapped in a twisted version of your life. Sound, lighting, and art direction combine to tell a story that worsens every day. The narrative is linear, but your choices change the pace of events. One small decision leads to big consequences. But do you know which one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on tension and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Growing terror through sound and aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random mazes making every play unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro pixelated 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal combat, lots of running and hiding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linear narrative with choices that impact the story\u2019s flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your life twist and fall apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls: run, hide, survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/gif_01.gif?t=1750269686\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What does FoMO mean?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It stands for \u201cFear of Missing Out,\u201d the anxiety that you\u2019re missing out on exciting events, movies, or social media trends \u2013 unless you\u2019re connected 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2632690?t=1750269686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750269686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750269686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750269686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features depictions of violence, blood, and imagery that some may find disturbing."},"demos":[{"appid":2995870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Face your fears, survive the chaos.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up. Work. Drink. Sleep. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That was your life \u2014 until everything went out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, everything is... wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your apartment is rotting. The bar is empty and silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the office has become a maze where creatures wait in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re not a hero.\u00a0You have no weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can only run \u2014 or get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/gif_02.gif?t=1750269686\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FoMO is a first-person psychological horror game focused on consequences, escape, and constant tension. No intense combat. Danger is everywhere \u2014 and you need to think fast to get away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, hide, survive. With random mazes, every run is unique. No escape is the same. The retro visuals and pixelated 3D graphics create a nostalgic \u2014 yet disturbing \u2014 atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re trapped in a twisted version of your life. Sound, lighting, and art direction combine to tell a story that worsens every day. The narrative is linear, but your choices change the pace of events. One small decision leads to big consequences. But do you know which one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on tension and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Growing terror through sound and aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random mazes making every play unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro pixelated 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal combat, lots of running and hiding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linear narrative with choices that impact the story\u2019s flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your life twist and fall apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls: run, hide, survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/extras/gif_01.gif?t=1750269686\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What does FoMO mean?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It stands for \u201cFear of Missing Out,\u201d the anxiety that you\u2019re missing out on exciting events, movies, or social media trends \u2013 unless you\u2019re connected 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Quantic Monkey Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632690/header.jpg?t=1750269686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257003508,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257003508/movie480.mp4?t=1717895761","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257003508/movie_max.mp4?t=1717895761"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257003508/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717895761","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257003508/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1717895761","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257003508/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1717895761"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257031386,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257031386/movie480.mp4?t=1718422529","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257031386/movie_max.mp4?t=1718422529"},"name":"Cat","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257031